OL,3,GNEWSARejection of #800m solar farm 'big
OL,4,Ablow' - developers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government decision to reject
OL,7,Fproposals for one of Europe's largest
OL,8,Fsolar farms is a "big blow" to the
OL,9,Flocal area, the developers behind the
OL,10,Fscheme have said.
OL,12,FThe #800m Botley West solar farm in
OL,13,FOxfordshire would have spread across
OL,14,Fmore than 2,000 acres of land to the
OL,15,Fnorth and west of Oxford.
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, the Secretary of State for
OL,18,FEnergy Security and Net Zero rejected
OL,19,Fthe plans, saying they would cause
OL,20,F"substantial" harm to greenbelt and
OL,21,Fheritage assets.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
